      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Augusta%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Every July, Augusta hosts the Hancock County Fair, a long‑standing celebration of local agriculture and community spirit.",
